p_k=c_k x^{i_k}y^{j_k}f^{u_k}g^{v_k}
h_-^{a_k}h_+^{b_k}\ell^{d_k}T_k,
\tag{14.12}
$$

with the following complete table. Each row is an identity in $\mathbb Z[x,y]$ determined by (14.7), (14.9)–(14.11).

